---
export const prerender = true;
import Base from '@layouts/Base.astro';
import { Guestbook } from '../components/Guestbook';
import '../styles/components/_prose.css';
---

<Base title="about" description="a little about me and this site.">
  <div class="about-content">
    <h1>about</h1>
    <p>
      the first thing i ever built was a working clock for my telegram nickname.
      a very serious problem, clearly. it worked, it felt like magic, and that's
      more or less how i ended up learning to code in high school.
    </p>

    <p>
      after school i went to PDP Academy for the backend basics: python, django,
      databases, algorithms. i had good mentors there, and most of what i've
      learned since came from building my own projects.
    </p>

    <p>
      now i code for a living. work pulled me from python and django into
      node.js, typescript and vue, and i got comfortable faster than i expected.
      these days i'm contributing to real projects, which is the fun part.
    </p>

    <p>
      i'm curious about how fast AI is moving and what it means for writing
      software. i use it to move quicker, find my way around code i've never
      seen, brainstorm and learn. my one rule is that i want to understand
      everything i build.
    </p>

    <p>
      outside of work it's side projects, reading about new tech, and following
      developers on x (probably more than i should).
    </p>

    <p>
      i'm early in my career and i know it. i like getting better through real
      work, and i'm looking for a place where i can keep growing, learn from
      programmers stronger than me, and build things people actually use.
    </p>

    <p>
      this site is where i keep my projects, notes and anything else worth
      remembering. if you find something useful here, that's a nice bonus ;)
    </p>
  </div>

  <Guestbook client:idle />
  <noscript>
    <p class="guestbook-noscript">
      the guestbook needs javascript to load and post notes. with it off, you
      can still say hi at <a href="mailto:hello@oddava.me">hello@oddava.me</a>.
    </p>
  </noscript>
</Base>
